    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3847\">Level 3 — <strong data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3847\">Centered Breath</strong></h2><p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3872\">You regulate your Burn.</p><h3 data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3896\">Mechanical Effects</h3><ul data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"4026\"><li data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"3952\"><p data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3952\">Reduce Burn gained by <strong data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3940\">1 per encounter</strong> (minimum 0)</p></li><li data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4026\"><p data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3996\">Once per round, when you would gain Burn:</p><ul data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4026\"><li data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4026\"><p data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4026\">You may choose <strong data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4026\">not to</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4041\">Additionally:</p><ul data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4130\"><li data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4130\"><p data-start=\"4044\" data-end=\"4130\">Allies within 2 squares reroll the lowest die on their<strong data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4130\">first check vs fear or charm each round</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4145\">Calm spreads.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
